es, 2.31x the prior 10-day average of 3.5M. It held, never closing below the level three days running, reached a best close of $741.79, and the chart ends at $732.94.","lesson":"This is an example of a textbook breakout: a base, then a close above it on heavy volume, and it held. This is the pattern the rules are built around."}}